{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ana is a botanist leaving Old Willow to venture into the heart of the forest and study some unique local plants. Little does she know, she\u2019s about to uncover unsettling truths that got as far as the depths of the forest.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.poster.avif?t=1770332885\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.webm?t=1770332885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.mp4?t=1770332885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Explore an abandoned cabin in the depths of the forest, uncovering secrets and solving puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Cook bizarre recipes \u2014 experimenting in the kitchen is key to uncovering hidden paths, objects, and lore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0This game rewards curiosity with secret scenes and new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Hand-drawn 2D artstyle with a moody feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Conversations, forgotten notes and old newspapers contain history, allowing you to gradually find out more about this unsettling place by playing detective.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1770332885\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0No jumpscares. Horror focused on atmosphere and unease, no loud surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/876bad8ec9d358b0bcceee23ce422f54.avif?t=1770332885\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0Wander the forest, collect strange plants, &amp; share coffee with mysterious beings in <i>Nightfall Caf\u00e9</i>.\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/37fbba6d693193c091daf4316ba67f67.webp?t=1770332885\" width=22 height=22 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/19a2d51c2b57cc70d1b1a37f5d8faf7d.avif?t=1770332885\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816920?t=1770332885","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/7d02175d77669f7c894f429c1f0bb41a8a838be5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770332885","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/777d46c3f57247d1d4c0a5aed0aa8860e12da2a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770332885","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/777d46c3f57247d1d4c0a5aed0aa8860e12da2a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770332885","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4099470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ana is a botanist leaving Old Willow to venture into the heart of the forest and study some unique local plants. Little does she know, she\u2019s about to uncover unsettling truths that got as far as the depths of the forest.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.poster.avif?t=1770332885\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.webm?t=1770332885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.mp4?t=1770332885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas